-Edit → Project Settings → Graphics → Default Render Pipeline → 𝗨𝗡𝗦_𝗨𝗥𝗣
-
-Also assign 𝗨𝗡𝗦_𝗨𝗥𝗣 to every Quality Level you intend to use:
